Z||000000||Haze_Performance||11-20-2001||01:22 AM||||I'm looking for the size of your light-up PONTIAC taillights.. Can someone measure the largest letter... (I believe its the "N") & let me know how high and wide it is? Also, what's the spacing of the letters? <P>I'm trying to make a correct looking size for the Notchback light kit. It will have to be slightly smaller for the N.B. <P><BR>Thanks<BR>-Haze  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">   <P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/goodlife.gif">    <BR><FONT SIZE="1"><FONT COLOR="purple">Goto Website - <A HREF="http://www.ClassicFiero.com" TARGET=_blank>Click Here</A> </FONT></FONT>||||reg||14
Z||000001||WampusCat||11-20-2001||08:57 AM||||All letters 1 5/8" tall.<BR>P is 2 3/8" from reverse light and 2 3/8" wide<BR>O is 3/4" from P and 2 5/8" wide<BR>N is 7/8" from O and 2 5/16' wide 1/4" to split<BR>T is 1/4" from split and 2 1/8" wide<BR>I is 3/4" from T and 5/16" wide<BR>A is 1/2" from I and 2 3/4" wide<BR>C is 1/4" from A and is 2 1/4" wide<BR>2 3/8" from C to reverse lights.<BR>All measurements taken before first cup of coffee so approximate at best.||||reg||1
Z||000002||Haze_Performance||11-20-2001||11:35 AM||||Thank you <B><I>very</I></B> much WampusCat..  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> Thats just what I was looking for....  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/goodlife.gif">    <BR><FONT SIZE="1"><FONT COLOR="purple">Goto Website - <A HREF="http://www.ClassicFiero.com" TARGET=_blank>Click Here</A> </FONT></FONT>||||reg||14
